  "description": "The loopback redirect receiver for OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect sign-in from native apps (RFC 8252) on Shiny.Net.HttpServer — the \"a browser opens, you sign in, the app gets the code\" flow desktop apps and CLIs use, on an ephemeral 127.0.0.1 port with state validation, form_post, timeouts and a customisable completion page. Not an OAuth client: PKCE and the token exchange stay with whichever client library you already use.",
